      "updated": 1794959155031,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Conventions (all screens):\n• Edit · Delete at the end of each table row,\n   or next to the selected item's title (Teams, Projects)\n• Edit turns the item into inputs with Save / Cancel\n• Keys can't be edited — apps use them in code\n• Delete always asks to confirm",
      "originalText": "Conventions (all screens):\n• Edit · Delete at the end of each table row,\n   or next to the selected item's title (Teams, Projects)\n• Edit turns the item into inputs with Save / Cancel\n• Keys can't be edited — apps use them in code\n• Delete always asks to confirm",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
