      "updated": 1794959156622,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Archived flags serve their off value in every environment. Restore puts the flag back in the list, OFF.\nDelete is permanent — apps then get the fallback in their code. Editors only; both ask to confirm.",
      "originalText": "Archived flags serve their off value in every environment. Restore puts the flag back in the list, OFF.\nDelete is permanent — apps then get the fallback in their code. Editors only; both ask to confirm.",
