    {
      "id": "Dheo27lCFqIYndeB8bM7O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6000,
      "y": 9890,
      "width": 396.00000000000006,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1686285195,
      "version": 333,
      "versionNonce": 1178201995,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794959364611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes\n• Flag + Variation = same in every environment\n• FlagEnvironment = per environment:\n   on/off, off value, targets, rules;\n   the last rule has no conditions and\n   is the default (= the on value)\n• a user's role in an environment =\n   highest role from their teams' rows\n• Log is append-only (never updated);\n   platform events are logged under the\n   platform company (targetType Company)\n• email unique system-wide\n   (one company per user)\n• FlagType = BOOLEAN | STRING | NUMBER | JSON\n• platform admin = ADMIN of the company\n   where isPlatform = true (derived, not stored)\n• Log is flat and self-contained: no FKs,\n   names are copied in, so deletes never\n   touch it\n• FlagHistory: one row per flag change,\n   shown in the History tab; deleted with\n   its flag or environment (CASCADE)\n• \"created by\" and \"last changed by\" come\n   from FlagHistory — no table points to\n   User except TeamMember\n• offVariationId RESTRICT: a variation can't\n   be deleted while an environment serves it\n   as the off value (or uses it in a rule)",
      "originalText": "Notes\n• Flag + Variation = same in every environment\n• FlagEnvironment = per environment:\n   on/off, off value, targets, rules;\n   the last rule has no conditions and\n   is the default (= the on value)\n• a user's role in an environment =\n   highest role from their teams' rows\n• Log is append-only (never updated);\n   platform events are logged under the\n   platform company (targetType Company)\n• email unique system-wide\n   (one company per user)\n• FlagType = BOOLEAN | STRING | NUMBER | JSON\n• platform admin = ADMIN of the company\n   where isPlatform = true (derived, not stored)\n• Log is flat and self-contained: no FKs,\n   names are copied in, so deletes never\n   touch it\n• FlagHistory: one row per flag change,\n   shown in the History tab; deleted with\n   its flag or environment (CASCADE)\n• \"created by\" and \"last changed by\" come\n   from FlagHistory — no table points to\n   User except TeamMember\n• offVariationId RESTRICT: a variation can't\n   be deleted while an environment serves it\n   as the off value (or uses it in a rule)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "c1A9",
      "created": 1794959158152,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
